"        \"Positive electrode interfacial current density [A.m-2]\",\n"
"        \"Positive particle surface concentration [mol.m-3]\",\n"
"        \"Average positive particle surface concentration [mol.m-3]\",\n"
"        [\"Positive electrode OCP [V]\", \"Voltage [V]\"],\n"
